/.idea/
**/.idea/

# ImGui
**/imgui.ini

**/*.log

# IDE databases and native linker/compiler intermediates must never be
# committed. Large instances of these files exist in old history; cleanup is
# forward-only and deliberately does not rewrite published commits.
**/*.VC.db
**/*.ipch
**/*.ilk
**/*.pdb
**/Browse.VC.db

# Legacy GameServer runtime logs bundled in the upstream history.
/MuServer_Season_5_Update_15/GameServer/LOG/*.txt
/Source MuServer Update 15/**/LOG/*.txt

